  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The Club Canin Dracenois is listed in Draguignan, on boulevard Général Leclerc, as a dog training and sport club with a large secure ground, classes for puppies and adults and competition preparation. This information comes from a directory: it could not be confirmed by an official source.</p>

      <h2>What could not be verified</h2>
      <p>The club publishes no website or social media page, and appears neither in the register of associations nor on the website of the town of Draguignan (consulted on 13 November 2026). Among the dog associations in the register for the town are other organisations (a breed club and an association helping dog owners), not this club. The club therefore cannot be contacted online from the sources read.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: before making the trip with your dog, check by phone or with the Draguignan town hall (04 94 60 31 31) that the club still exists at this address.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Draguignan, a town in the centre of the Var, has several independent dog trainers who work at home or outdoors, some of whom publish their contact details online: an option if the club does not answer.</p>
